            </note>
            <note corresp="#d704-f2" n="32" xml:id="d704-f2-content">
                <p>Norman J. O. Makin was Australian Ambassador; and Joseph B. Chifley, Prime
                    Minister; telegram not printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
